# SHA-256 baseline for workshop/site/hackathon.html, frozen by AC21 (specs/005-teaching-spa.md).
# The digest is of the page's LF form, which is the bytes git stores. A core.autocrlf=true checkout
# holds the same page with CRLF line endings, so a raw hash of that working copy differs; the AC21
# test hashes the LF form and accepts the page in either form.
# Reproduce from a POSIX shell: git show HEAD:workshop/site/hackathon.html | sha256sum
0fc164d64b5f03ccb76256f876641026297a35c14e10c6c73b15a74aea9a61cb
